\pard\sa140\sb320\f0\fs30\b\cf2 Experiment 8 -- de-biasing the answer key\b0\par
\pard\sa140\f0\fs22\cf1 Answer key: 1,035-query, pooled to 22,124 rows during the run. Runtime about 38 minutes. Prerequisites: cyberfaces-hn-code, cyberfaces-hn-data.\par
\pard\sa140\li240\f0\fs21\b\cf4 NOTE: \b0 Do NOT split pooling and comparison into separate Jobs. The pooled answer key exists only on the pod's filesystem and dies with it; the manifest chains both steps into one command on purpose. This was learned twice.\par
\pard\li360\sa0\f1\fs18\cf3 kubectl --context=anvil apply -f evaluate/k8s/hn-pool-job.yaml\par
